# Tests

This directory contains automated tests for Human4Human.

## Scope

Depending on the project architecture, tests may include:

* Unit tests.
* Integration tests.
* End-to-end tests.
* Regression tests.
* Security and performance tests where appropriate.

## Guidelines

* Write tests for new functionality and bug fixes.
* Keep tests deterministic and independent whenever possible.
* Use descriptive test names that explain the expected behavior.
* Document any required test data, configuration, or setup.
* Ensure the relevant test suite passes before merging changes.

Testing tools and commands will be documented once the project's technology stack is established.
